menu "IMX462 camera sensor"

    config CAMERA_IMX462_BAYER_PATTERN
        int "Bayer pattern of the cropped window (0 RGGB, 1 GRBG, 2 GBRG, 3 BGGR)"
        range 0 3
        default 0
        help
            The IMX290 family reads out RGGB. If the picture comes out with red
            and blue swapped, use 3; a green or magenta cast means 1 or 2.

    config CAMERA_IMX462_MAX_GAIN_STEP
        int "Highest gain step the AGC may use (0.3 dB each)"
        range 0 230
        default 140
        help
            0..90 is analogue gain (0 to 27 dB). Steps above that add digital
            gain on top, up to 230 = 69 dB. 140 is 42 dB.

    config CAMERA_IMX462_NIGHT_MAX_GAIN_STEP
        int "Highest gain step in night mode (0.3 dB each)"
        range 0 230
        default 170

    config CAMERA_IMX462_HCG
        bool "High conversion gain (HCG) mode"
        default y
        help
            The IMX462's low-noise, low-light mode. Costs highlight headroom.

endmenu
